*>   1998-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 627
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0023.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0023C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 PEN-WAIVE-FLG      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 PEN-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "PEN-WAIVE-FLG=" PEN-WAIVE-FLG
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF FIRST-FIRST-TIME
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
            WHEN CUSTOMER-TIER = 'G' OR CUSTOMER-TIER = 'P'
                SET PEN-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0.00 TO LATE-CHARGE
            *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER - LIMIT 1.5 PER 1998 POLICY
            WHEN DPD-DAYS <= 3
                SET PEN-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
